Error [E0225]: `&` marks a fresh value, not a named place
  --> receiver_mark_extra_fresh.jet:8:5
    |
  8 |     &make_buffer().append("!")
    |     ^
 Why: A mark binds a name plus fields, indexes, or ranges; a call result or literal is new, so the call receives it without a mark
 Fix: Remove `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0225
